<title>FINLAND: FINNISH FEB JOBLESS RATE FALLS TO 15.8 PCT -SF.</title>
<headline>FINNISH FEB JOBLESS RATE FALLS TO 15.8 PCT -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate</p>
<p>fell to 15.8 percent in February from 16.7 percent in January,</p>
<p>Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>			 Feb 1997     Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   394,000	411,000	 423,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  15.8	   16.7	    17.3</p>
<p>The figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis,</p>
<p>earlier said the February 1997 unemployment rate fell to 17.8</p>
<p>percent from 18.5 percent in January.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
